{"id":"d94d9ef3ea3cdf77","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-rp-contained-np.md","title":"RP ⊆ NP","display":"thm-rp-contained-np — RP ⊆ NP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-rp-contained-np","aliases":["28-thm-rp-contained-np","RP is Contained in NP"],"display":"thm-rp-contained-np — RP ⊆ NP","depends_on":["[[28-df-rp]]","[[28-df-np]]"],"source_book_location":"§7.3 following Definition 7.6; printed p.131; PDF p.157","source_printed_pages":"131","source_pdf_pages":"157","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed","local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-rp-contained-np"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-rp-contained-np</span><span>RP is Contained in NP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rp-contained-np — RP ⊆ NP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"efc30a60f20cb4de\" href=\"?note=efc30a60f20cb4de\" title=\"28-df-rp\">28-df-rp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§7.3 following Definition 7.6; printed p.131; PDF p.157"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"131"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"157"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{RP}\">\\(\\mathbf{RP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"efc30a60f20cb4de\" href=\"?note=efc30a60f20cb4de\" title=\"28-df-rp\">28-df-rp</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a>。</li>\n<li>对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathbf{RP}\">\\(L\\in\\mathbf{RP}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,a,b,c\">\\(M,a,b,c\\)</span> 为其见证，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(n)=c(n+1)^b\">\\(q(n)=c(n+1)^b\\)</span>；随机带长度和时间界均为多项式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{RP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{RP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{q(|x|)}\\;M(x;r)=1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{q(|x|)}\\;M(x;r)=1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>是实例的正接受概率保证存在一条接受随机带；否实例的零接受概率在有限均匀空间中排除所有接受随机带。确定型机器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 即是多项式时间证书验证者。显式限定证书长度，修复原稿无界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists r\">\\(\\exists r\\)</span> 与游离 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的量词问题。</p>\n<p>R6本地证明复核：已复核本节所列完整概率/模拟推导；此状态针对本地论证，不把旧来源定位自动升级为逐页证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-rp","status":"resolved","id":"efc30a60f20cb4de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-rp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-rp","status":"resolved","id":"efc30a60f20cb4de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{RP}$ 见 [[28-df-rp]]，$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{RP}$ 见 [[28-df-rp]]，$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{RP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathbf{RP}","display":false},{"tex":"M,a,b,c","display":false},{"tex":"q(n)=c(n+1)^b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{RP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{q(|x|)}\\;M(x;r)=1\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists r","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1414,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"类关系：[[28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp]]、[[28-thm-rp-contained-np]]、[[28-thm-adleman]]、[[28-thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann]]。"}],"outgoing":["efc30a60f20cb4de","0cb5248561455df8"]}